{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04576","headline":"相州山池作 · 张说","name":"相州山池作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尝怀谢公咏，山水陶嘉月。\n及此年事衰，徒看衆花发。\n观鱼乐何在，听鸟情都歇。\n星汉流不停，蓬莱去难越。\n邺中秋麦秀，淇上春云没。\n日见尘物空，如何静心阙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04576.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04576","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}